# Frontend Conventions

Read `cursor/projects/frontend/cursor-rules-frontend.md` before changing `src/**`.

- Routes in `src/routes/`; role IDs in `src/constants/auth.ts`. Do not hardcode paths or role GUIDs.
- API calls in `src/services/` via `src/services/apiConfig.ts` — no hardcoded URLs or secrets.
- Request/response shapes in `src/types/`. Keep MSW handlers and Cypress aligned with backend Swagger.
- UI primitives in `src/components/ui/`. Tailwind + `cn()` from `src/lib/utils.ts`.
- Auth is the only global state (`src/store/AuthContext.tsx`).
- Env via `VITE_*` / `import.meta.env`. Document new keys.
- Unit tests next to components; E2E in `cypress/e2e/`.
